e icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[1715,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[1714,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[517,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[1717,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1628,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[1874,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[590,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[1753,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[1748,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[1750,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[1749,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[588,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[1752,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[323,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[322,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[574,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[514,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1494,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[693,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `