 y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1700,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1757,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[573,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1698,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[575,"**DOM Output:**"],[1610,"**End**"],[520,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1539,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[591,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[579,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[564,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[513,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1224,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[567,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1716,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1728,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1608,"**Home**"],[1731,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1720,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1910,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1901,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non