es VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[570,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1330,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1327,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1336,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1337,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1325,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1331,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1334,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1328,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1340,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[154,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[1955,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1957,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1951,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[1953,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[1958,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[1954,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1952,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1956,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1908,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[452,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1535,"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, so a `Tag` eyebrow stays centered too."],[1066,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1191,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[274,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[334,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[1067,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[1192,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[336,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1069,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1614,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[1193,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[273,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[967,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[335,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[1068,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[271,"`aria-val